## Solution Format

Each solution contains:

* Problem name and LeetCode link
* Problem number
* Difficulty
* Approach
* Time complexity
* Space complexity
* Implementation

Example:

```text
Problem: Two Sum
Difficulty: Easy

Approach:
Use a hash map to store previously visited numbers and their indices.

Complexity:
Time:  O(n)
Space: O(n)
```

